  <name>Mango Settings</name>
  <summary>Settings manager for the MangoWM Wayland compositor</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Mango Settings is a GNOME Settings-style graphical configuration tool for
      the MangoWM Wayland compositor. It edits MangoWM's configuration files
      directly, preserving comments, ordering, symlinks and permissions.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Pages for appearance, animations, layouts, keybindings, workspaces, window rules, monitors, input devices, startup apps, theming and wallpapers</li>
      <li>Search across all settings and a keybinding editor with conflict detection</li>
      <li>Reset any setting to MangoWM's default</li>
      <li>Atomic writes with timestamped backups and external-change detection</li>
      <li>Headless configuration validation with <code>--check</code></li>
    </ul>
  </description>
